meta-arago-extras provides additional TI applications that are distro-agnostic

The source repository is hosted at https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-arago

This layer works with the latest Yocto Project and tracks the "master"
branches of the corresponding layers:

URI: https://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core
branch: master
revision: HEAD
layers: meta

URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-ti
branch: master
revision: HEAD
layers: meta-ti-bsp, meta-ti-extras

URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-arm
branch: master
revision: HEAD
layers: meta-arm, meta-arm-toolchain

URI: https://git.openembedded.org/meta-openembedded
branch: master
revision: HEAD
layers: meta-oe, meta-networking

Send pull requests, patches, comments or questions to:
meta-arago@lists.yoctoproject.org

Please note - meta-arago mailing list requires subscription for posting:
https://lists.yoctoproject.org/g/meta-arago

Layer maintainers:
Ryan Eatmon <reatmon@ti.com>
Denys Dmytriyenko <denys@konsulko.com>
